---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — VisaPath.pk"
  description="How VisaPath.pk collects, uses, and protects your information."
>
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10 prose">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: October 2026</em></p>

    <h2>Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      VisaPath.pk ("we", "our", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect when you use our website and how we use it.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Information you provide:</strong> If you contact us by email, we receive your email address and the content of your message.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Automatic data:</strong> Like most websites, we automatically collect standard log information including your IP address, browser type, device type, pages visited, and timestamps. This is used for site analytics and security.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Calculator inputs:</strong> The data you enter into our calculators (travel dates, visa types, etc.) is processed in your browser only. We do not store or transmit this information.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies and Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use our site. Google Analytics uses cookies to collect anonymous usage data. You can opt out by installing the Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on.
    </p>

    <h2>Advertising</h2>
    <p>
      We may display advertisements served by Google AdSense and other third-party ad networks. These services may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's Ads Settings.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
    <p>
      Our site contains links to third-party websites, including embassy websites and affiliate partners. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of these sites.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain analytics data for up to 26 months. Email correspondence is retained as long as necessary to respond and for record-keeping.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of any personal data we hold by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@visapath.pk">hello@visapath.pk</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? Email <a href="mailto:hello@visapath.pk">hello@visapath.pk</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
